<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.720" end="00:00:05.000" style="s2">30 years, everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.080" end="00:00:08.400" style="s2">I&#39;ll be honest, marrying you was my</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.000" end="00:00:08.400" style="s2">worst mistake, Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.825" end="00:00:12.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.080" end="00:00:15.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The smile of Meg freezes as 200 guests</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.760" end="00:00:15.280" style="s2">laugh.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.375" end="00:00:18.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.880" end="00:00:24.890" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, she knows I&#39;m joking.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.440" end="00:00:26.855" style="s2">30 years OF JOKING.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.890" end="00:00:28.875" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.855" end="00:00:28.875" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.120" end="00:00:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE&#39;S FORGOTTEN WHOSE NAME IS ON THOSE</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.680" end="00:00:37.335" style="s2">SHARES, Miss Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.000" end="00:00:39.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s about to remember by sunrise.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.335" end="00:00:40.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.300" end="00:00:41.120" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.610" end="00:00:43.120" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.120" end="00:00:46.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Richard.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.120" end="00:00:46.360" style="s2">You&#39;re terrible.</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.505" end="00:00:48.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.280" end="00:00:53.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.840" end="00:00:53.760" style="s2">that&#39;s not funny.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.320" end="00:01:03.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard Harlow, I&#39;ve heard better jokes</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.000" end="00:01:03.440" style="s2">in a dentist&#39;s office.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.500" end="00:01:10.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.640" end="00:01:10.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Bee, you&#39;ve had too much sherry.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.080" end="00:01:16.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg picks up her purse and an unopened</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.240" end="00:01:19.255" style="s2">cream envelope and walks off the terrace</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.480" end="00:01:21.275" style="s2">without a word.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.255" end="00:01:21.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.520" end="00:01:25.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg walks alone across the sunny green</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.840" end="00:01:28.800" style="s2">lawn [music] toward the parking lot as</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.280" end="00:01:28.800" style="s2">the party laughs behind her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.735" end="00:01:32.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.880" end="00:01:35.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That morning sunlight sparkles on the</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.800" end="00:01:39.120" style="s2">lake beyond tall windows as Meg arranges</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.280" end="00:01:39.120" style="s2">white roses on the breakfast table.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.560" end="00:01:45.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years today, Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.720" end="00:01:47.880" style="s2">you drove me to the church in that</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.320" end="00:01:47.880" style="s2">truck.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.200" end="00:01:55.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell them I&#39;ll call back.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.280" end="00:01:58.400" style="s2">It&#39;s my anniversary.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.800" end="00:01:58.400" style="s2">Optics.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.680" end="00:02:06.212" style="s2">Happy anniversary, Meg. You look nice.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.972" end="00:02:09.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years, Rick. I thought you might look</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.212" end="00:02:09.212" style="s2">up from your phone.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.212" end="00:02:13.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t forget.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.052" end="00:02:16.292" style="s2">Open it later. It&#39;s just the proxy</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.692" end="00:02:18.772" style="s2">renewal. Every 10 years, you know the</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.292" end="00:02:18.772" style="s2">drill.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.132" end="00:02:26.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The proxy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.972" end="00:02:26.092" style="s2">For our anniversary.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.376" end="00:02:31.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.572" end="00:02:33.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Romance and paperwork.</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.172" end="00:02:37.292" style="s2">That&#39;s us, darling. Sign it before the</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.372" end="00:02:39.332" style="s2">party. Janet needs it Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.292" end="00:02:42.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg said, &quot;Daddy always said read</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.332" end="00:02:42.812" style="s2">everything before you sign it.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.292" end="00:02:52.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your daddy&#39;s been gone 12 years, Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.372" end="00:02:52.332" style="s2">I&#39;ve run his company longer than he did.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.812" end="00:02:59.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve run it, Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.652" end="00:02:59.452" style="s2">He built it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.132" end="00:03:06.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same thing on a balance sheet.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.492" end="00:03:12.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Happy anniversary.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.772" end="00:03:13.972" style="s2">30 years.</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.452" end="00:03:14.537" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.972" end="00:03:15.012" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.537" end="00:03:17.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.012" end="00:03:17.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you&#39;re goals.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.252" end="00:03:23.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother&#39;s being sentimental about</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.852" end="00:03:26.612" style="s2">her father again.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.452" end="00:03:26.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s sweet, Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.932" end="00:03:31.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg smiles at her daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.572" end="00:03:42.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the coffee?</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.172" end="00:03:44.667" style="s2">I&#39;m 84. I don&#39;t do mornings without</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.692" end="00:03:46.687" style="s2">fuel.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.667" end="00:03:46.687" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.532" end="00:03:55.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years. I gave it 18 months.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.212" end="00:03:55.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Bee.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.372" end="00:04:03.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.092" end="00:04:03.254" style="s2">Still sitting in my brother&#39;s chair.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.734" end="00:04:09.334" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bea,</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.174" end="00:04:12.454" style="s2">lovely as ever.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.334" end="00:04:12.454" style="s2">Are you coming to the club?</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.574" end="00:04:18.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Free champagne and rich people falling</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.694" end="00:04:21.694" style="s2">over?</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.574" end="00:04:21.694" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t miss it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.174" end="00:04:28.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna&#39;s running the party,</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.214" end="00:04:31.654" style="s2">our new events coordinator.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.414" end="00:04:31.654" style="s2">She&#39;s very efficient.</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.334" end="00:04:40.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Efficient.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.974" end="00:04:40.414" style="s2">That&#39;s what they call it now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.894" end="00:04:46.574" style="s2">Aunt Bea,</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.054" end="00:04:52.374" style="s2">Maggie,</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.654" end="00:04:53.654" style="s2">I saw him with that coordinator at the</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.374" end="00:04:55.014" style="s2">marina.</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.654" end="00:04:57.894" style="s2">Twice.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.014" end="00:05:01.574" style="s2">Holding hands.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.894" end="00:05:01.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg stares at the envelope.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.233" end="00:05:07.253" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.694" end="00:05:12.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Irrevocable.</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.334" end="00:05:16.934" style="s2">He wrote irrevocable.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.654" end="00:05:19.334" style="s2">Every other renewal was 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.934" end="00:05:23.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A fine print paragraph on the proxy page</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.334" end="00:05:23.094" style="s2">under the reading glasses of Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.414" end="00:05:30.734" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father wrote that proxy rule</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.134" end="00:05:33.374" style="s2">himself.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.734" end="00:05:36.094" style="s2">10 years at a time, so nobody gets too</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.374" end="00:05:36.094" style="s2">comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.294" end="00:05:41.774" style="s2">And Rick wants it forever.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.654" end="00:05:47.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.894" end="00:05:50.494" style="s2">you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.694" end="00:05:50.494" style="s2">You look pale.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.894" end="00:05:57.734" style="s2">I&#39;m fine, sweetheart. Just reading.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.214" end="00:06:00.614" style="s2">Grandpa&#39;s thing.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.734" end="00:06:00.614" style="s2">Read everything.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.814" end="00:06:06.855" style="s2">Grandpa&#39;s thing.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.815" end="00:06:12.855" style="s2">Well, I&#39;m reading the buffet at the</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.495" end="00:06:14.815" style="s2">club.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.855" end="00:06:17.575" style="s2">Let&#39;s go before your husband eats all</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.815" end="00:06:17.575" style="s2">the shrimp.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.215" end="00:06:23.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg slips the unsigned envelope into her</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.615" end="00:06:23.175" style="s2">purse.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.375" end="00:06:34.015" style="s2">Meg, Bea, and Claire walk out to a car</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.135" end="00:06:34.015" style="s2">parked beside the sparkling lake.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.314" end="00:06:36.334" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.695" end="00:06:40.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On the sunny club terrace before the</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.575" end="00:06:43.295" style="s2">party, Henry polishes glasses [music] at</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.455" end="00:06:43.295" style="s2">the long bar.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.775" end="00:06:51.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years, I poured the champagne at your</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.575" end="00:06:54.619" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.495" end="00:06:56.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, you poured it on Rick&#39;s shoes.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.619" end="00:06:56.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.415" end="00:07:02.815" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father tipped [music] me $50 for</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.375" end="00:07:02.815" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.064" end="00:07:10.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.255" end="00:07:10.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy never liked the shoes.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.649" end="00:07:14.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.015" end="00:07:16.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He liked you, Miss Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.975" end="00:07:17.855" style="s2">Every Friday, right on [music] that</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.535" end="00:07:20.820" style="s2">stool.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.855" end="00:07:22.840" style="s2">Talked about you the whole time.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.820" end="00:07:22.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.895" end="00:07:25.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one?</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.375" end="00:07:32.010" style="s2">Is this the exact [music] same spot?</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.990" end="00:07:32.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.175" end="00:07:34.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That one.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.920" end="00:07:36.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.695" end="00:07:39.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Said you were the only one who read the</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.535" end="00:07:39.455" style="s2">fine print.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.975" end="00:07:49.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, the champagne tower, now. Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.015" end="00:07:51.660" style="s2">Harlow, you&#39;re early. We start at 2:00.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.640" end="00:07:51.660" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.815" end="00:07:55.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg said, &quot;It&#39;s my anniversary party.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.225" end="00:07:57.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.135" end="00:07:58.855" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna replied, &quot;And Richard&#39;s investor</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.455" end="00:08:01.815" style="s2">event.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.855" end="00:08:01.815" style="s2">Two birds.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.695" end="00:08:04.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blue.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.395" end="00:08:06.015" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.415" end="00:08:06.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bold choice.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.015" end="00:08:09.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.255" end="00:08:11.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard said you&#39;d wear something safe.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.945" end="00:08:11.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.297" end="00:08:15.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard doesn&#39;t know what I&#39;d wear.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.150" end="00:08:19.170" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.497" end="00:08:23.755" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He knows a lot of things.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.735" end="00:08:23.755" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.897" end="00:08:31.337" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry we haven&#39;t met properly.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.737" end="00:08:31.337" style="s2">You are?</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.617" end="00:08:38.297" style="s2">Sienna.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.817" end="00:08:39.537" style="s2">Events.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.297" end="00:08:42.137" style="s2">And special [music] projects for</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.537" end="00:08:42.137" style="s2">Richard.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.177" end="00:08:49.137" style="s2">Special [music] projects. I had a few of</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.697" end="00:08:52.521" style="s2">those in 1968.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.137" end="00:08:53.577" style="s2">We called them husbands.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.521" end="00:08:56.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.577" end="00:08:56.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.106" end="00:09:00.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.537" end="00:09:03.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be, honey.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.257" end="00:09:03.217" style="s2">Be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.577" end="00:09:10.937" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gentlemen, my wife, Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.697" end="00:09:14.137" style="s2">30 years. She inherited the company.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.937" end="00:09:14.137" style="s2">I made it worth something.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.537" end="00:09:18.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg [music] smiles politely.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.651" end="00:09:26.337" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.497" end="00:09:29.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you sign it?</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.337" end="00:09:29.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.817" end="00:09:36.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg, it&#39;s one signature.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.857" end="00:09:39.777" style="s2">Sign it before the toast. I want to</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.177" end="00:09:39.777" style="s2">announce the Cartwright merger.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.991" end="00:09:45.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.337" end="00:09:45.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What merger?</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.537" end="00:09:50.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Business.</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.057" end="00:09:53.436" style="s2">Boring.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.617" end="00:09:55.456" style="s2">Sign it, darling.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.436" end="00:09:55.456" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.537" end="00:09:58.537" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After the party.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.641" end="00:10:04.626" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.606" end="00:10:04.626" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.846" end="00:10:09.866" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.857" end="00:10:15.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Merger? First I&#39;ve heard of it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.498" end="00:10:17.017" style="s2">Usually these old men talk loud at my</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.698" end="00:10:19.037" style="s2">bar.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.017" end="00:10:19.037" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.778" end="00:10:24.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.898" end="00:10:27.818" style="s2">if anything strange happens today,</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.458" end="00:10:27.818" style="s2">will you remember it for me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.152" end="00:10:30.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.258" end="00:10:37.978" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Meg, I remember everything.</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.258" end="00:10:37.978" style="s2">And my phone remembers more.</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.632" end="00:10:44.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.418" end="00:10:44.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, they&#39;re doing photos.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.738" end="00:10:50.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Coming, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.112" end="00:10:53.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.218" end="00:10:55.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad says he&#39;s got a big surprise toast.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.697" end="00:10:55.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.538" end="00:11:00.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sure he does.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.282" end="00:11:00.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.978" end="00:11:06.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m taking these.</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.778" end="00:11:07.452" style="s2">30 years of overpriced shrimp, somebody</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.018" end="00:11:09.472" style="s2">owes me napkins.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.452" end="00:11:09.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.692" end="00:11:14.458" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.738" end="00:11:17.277" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Knock &#39;em dead.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.458" end="00:11:17.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I always do.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.277" end="00:11:18.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.932" end="00:11:21.018" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.898" end="00:11:23.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Across the bright terrace, Meg watches</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.018" end="00:11:26.058" style="s2">Sienna fix the tie of Richard while</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.018" end="00:11:26.058" style="s2">Henry watches her.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.178" end="00:11:33.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome everyone to this wonderful day.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.458" end="00:11:35.618" style="s2">Today we celebrate [music] 40 years of</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.418" end="00:11:38.298" style="s2">love, laughter, and unforgettable</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.618" end="00:11:38.298" style="s2">memories.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.058" end="00:11:44.378" style="s2">Friends, family, investors, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.218" end="00:11:47.218" style="s2">30 years ago today I married Meg</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.378" end="00:11:47.218" style="s2">Lindquist.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.408" end="00:11:50.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.978" end="00:11:52.648" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg stands by the stage with a hopeful</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.098" end="00:11:54.668" style="s2">smile.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.648" end="00:11:54.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.658" end="00:12:02.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her father gave me a job driving trucks.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.618" end="00:12:05.093" style="s2">Then he gave me his daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.658" end="00:12:07.113" style="s2">Then he gave me his company.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.093" end="00:12:07.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.058" end="00:12:12.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He gave you nothing. You took the keys.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.978" end="00:12:19.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I&#39;ll be honest,</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.499" end="00:12:20.819" style="s2">marrying you was my worst mistake, Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.299" end="00:12:22.778" style="s2">Her daddy&#39;s company was the only good</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.819" end="00:12:24.259" style="s2">part.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.778" end="00:12:26.419" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.259" end="00:12:27.363" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The smile of Meg freezes as the crowd</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.419" end="00:12:29.383" style="s2">laughs.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.363" end="00:12:29.383" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.948" end="00:12:33.968" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.379" end="00:12:40.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, she knows I&#39;m joking.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.019" end="00:12:42.483" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years of joking.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.463" end="00:12:42.483" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.019" end="00:12:48.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Richard,</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.323" end="00:12:51.779" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.739" end="00:12:51.779" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you&#39;re terrible.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.979" end="00:12:56.838" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.619" end="00:12:58.858" style="s2">that&#39;s not funny.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.838" end="00:12:58.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.619" end="00:13:06.179" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a little funny, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.339" end="00:13:13.459" style="s2">And next week, we merge with Cartwright</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.459" end="00:13:16.489" style="s2">Logistics. Harlow Freight goes national.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.459" end="00:13:17.144" style="s2">My name on every truck in America.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.489" end="00:13:18.619" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.144" end="00:13:21.339" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.619" end="00:13:21.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your name.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.779" end="00:13:29.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Behind the bar, Henry quietly holds up</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.979" end="00:13:29.019" style="s2">his phone, filming the stage.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.244" end="00:13:32.264" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.699" end="00:13:35.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To 30 years,</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.484" end="00:13:37.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.739" end="00:13:39.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and to the company that made them worth</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.699" end="00:13:39.979" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.724" end="00:13:41.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.379" end="00:13:43.699" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.499" end="00:13:45.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The crowd raises glasses and laughs as</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.699" end="00:13:47.274" style="s2">Richard beams on the stage.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.964" end="00:13:49.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.274" end="00:13:49.294" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.939" end="00:13:55.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg [music] slowly sets down her glass</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.939" end="00:13:55.539" style="s2">on the bar.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.719" end="00:14:02.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.939" end="00:14:03.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s forgotten whose name is on those</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.499" end="00:14:04.379" style="s2">shares, Ms. Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.649" end="00:14:08.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.379" end="00:14:08.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s about to remember, by sunrise.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.889" end="00:14:10.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.339" end="00:14:17.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard Harlow, I&#39;ve heard better jokes</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.859" end="00:14:17.661" style="s2">in a dentist&#39;s office.</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.714" end="00:14:20.734" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.021" end="00:14:24.981" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Bee, you&#39;ve had too much sherry.</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.574" end="00:14:28.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.061" end="00:14:34.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not nearly enough for this.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.089" end="00:14:38.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music and bell]</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.661" end="00:14:40.741" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg picks up her purse and the unopened</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.861" end="00:14:42.950" style="s2">envelope and walks off the terrace</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.741" end="00:14:44.260" style="s2">without a word.</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.950" end="00:14:46.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.260" end="00:14:46.280" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.781" end="00:14:51.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.621" end="00:14:51.621" style="s2">Mom, wait.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.120" end="00:14:54.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.581" end="00:14:58.181" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her go, Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.221" end="00:14:58.941" style="s2">Your mother&#39;s been fragile lately.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.181" end="00:15:00.635" style="s2">You&#39;ve noticed.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.941" end="00:15:02.655" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fragile?</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.635" end="00:15:02.655" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.661" end="00:15:05.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forgetful.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.220" end="00:15:07.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.661" end="00:15:09.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emotional.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.781" end="00:15:12.541" style="s2">I&#39;ve been worried.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.861" end="00:15:12.541" style="s2">We&#39;ll talk.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.861" end="00:15:17.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire looks after her mother, confused.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.045" end="00:15:17.065" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.940" end="00:15:22.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.501" end="00:15:28.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That went well.</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.180" end="00:15:28.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.420" end="00:15:33.461" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.741" end="00:15:36.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;ll sign.</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.461" end="00:15:36.781" style="s2">She always signs.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.315" end="00:15:40.645" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.625" end="00:15:40.645" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.210" end="00:15:45.861" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.581" end="00:15:47.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg walks alone across the sunny lawn</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.861" end="00:15:50.541" style="s2">toward the parking lot as the party</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.461" end="00:15:50.541" style="s2">laughs [music] behind her.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.901" end="00:15:57.021" style="s2">In the sunny parking lot under big leafy</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.000" end="00:16:01.221" style="s2">[music] oaks, Meg sits in her silver car</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.021" end="00:16:01.221" style="s2">with the door open, staring ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.341" end="00:16:06.791" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.901" end="00:16:08.811" style="s2">Worst mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.791" end="00:16:08.811" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.981" end="00:16:17.381" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I brought shrimp. Crying [music] goes</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.301" end="00:16:17.381" style="s2">better with shrimp.</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.926" end="00:16:20.822" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.501" end="00:16:24.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maggie, look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.822" end="00:16:24.382" style="s2">I&#39;m not crying, Aunt Bee.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.622" end="00:16:32.822" style="s2">I know. That&#39;s what scares me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.822" end="00:16:36.102" style="s2">Your father didn&#39;t cry, either.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.822" end="00:16:36.102" style="s2">He made phone calls.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.742" end="00:16:39.382" style="s2">He wanted me to sign this today.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.886" end="00:16:41.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.382" end="00:16:42.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Irrevocable.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.142" end="00:16:45.342" style="s2">Then he announced a merger I&#39;ve never</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.662" end="00:16:45.342" style="s2">heard of.</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.091" end="00:16:48.982" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.742" end="00:16:50.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cartwright Logistics.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.982" end="00:16:54.662" style="s2">They&#39;ve been trying to buy your father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.702" end="00:16:54.662" style="s2">company since 1990.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.916" end="00:16:59.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.462" end="00:17:01.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I sign, he votes my shares forever.</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.542" end="00:17:04.222" style="s2">He could sell Dad&#39;s company and I</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.142" end="00:17:04.222" style="s2">couldn&#39;t stop him.</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.462" end="00:17:12.291" style="s2">So, don&#39;t sign.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.702" end="00:17:14.311" style="s2">Read everything before you sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.291" end="00:17:14.311" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.142" end="00:17:20.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy&#39;s line.</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.462" end="00:17:28.011" style="s2">Daddy&#39;s line.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.582" end="00:17:30.032" style="s2">And his sisters.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.011" end="00:17:30.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.502" end="00:17:36.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Bee, the old proxy runs out tonight</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.942" end="00:17:39.142" style="s2">at 12:00. That&#39;s why he wanted it signed</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.422" end="00:17:39.142" style="s2">at the party.</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.822" end="00:17:45.022" style="s2">12:00.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.382" end="00:17:46.542" style="s2">Then at 1 minute past, your shares vote</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.022" end="00:17:49.542" style="s2">themselves.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.542" end="00:17:49.542" style="s2">51%.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.342" end="00:17:58.197" style="s2">By sunrise, I&#39;d own his seat.</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.177" end="00:17:58.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.797" end="00:18:03.142" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.422" end="00:18:06.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Maggie. Your father&#39;s grinning in</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.142" end="00:18:06.062" style="s2">his grave.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.582" end="00:18:11.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MISS MEG.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.302" end="00:18:16.537" style="s2">WAIT.</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.517" end="00:18:16.537" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.742" end="00:18:21.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I FILMED THE TOAST, ALL OF IT.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.182" end="00:18:24.397" style="s2">AND THE merger talk.</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.823" end="00:18:24.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, why? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.307" end="00:18:30.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.863" end="00:18:32.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years I watched him at that bar.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.103" end="00:18:36.063" style="s2">Your father trusted me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.503" end="00:18:36.063" style="s2">I&#39;m not letting him down now.</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.132" end="00:18:38.152" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.263" end="00:18:42.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.703" end="00:18:44.047" style="s2">And to Janet Pruitt.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.027" end="00:18:44.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.423" end="00:18:48.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company lawyer?</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.922" end="00:18:51.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.263" end="00:18:51.423" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;ll take his side.</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.818" end="00:18:57.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.503" end="00:18:59.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Janet was my father&#39;s lawyer first.</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.903" end="00:19:01.733" style="s2">She remembers.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.713" end="00:19:01.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.943" end="00:19:10.983" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll call Janet. She owes me. I typed</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.703" end="00:19:10.983" style="s2">her bar application in 1994.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.158" end="00:19:15.383" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.063" end="00:19:19.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Bea,</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.383" end="00:19:19.343" style="s2">is there anyone you didn&#39;t type for?</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.863" end="00:19:27.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your union contract, Henry.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.463" end="00:19:28.533" style="s2">1986.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.823" end="00:19:30.553" style="s2">You&#39;re welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.533" end="00:19:30.553" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.463" end="00:19:36.423" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.343" end="00:19:38.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was you?</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.423" end="00:19:40.378" style="s2">I remember that day.</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.358" end="00:19:40.378" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.103" end="00:19:45.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, can you meet us at Aunt Bea&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.583" end="00:19:48.463" style="s2">tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.703" end="00:19:48.463" style="s2">9:00.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.838" end="00:19:50.783" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.148" end="00:19:52.423" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.783" end="00:19:55.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get off at 8:00.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.423" end="00:19:55.663" style="s2">I&#39;ll bring the good coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.008" end="00:20:00.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.063" end="00:20:05.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Henry,</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.503" end="00:20:05.103" style="s2">thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.523" end="00:20:11.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.383" end="00:20:14.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father tipped me $50 once.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.503" end="00:20:14.263" style="s2">This one&#39;s free.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.383" end="00:20:17.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.783" end="00:20:19.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The silver car pulls out of the sunny</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.743" end="00:20:22.823" style="s2">lot with Meg at the wheel [music] and</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.223" end="00:20:22.823" style="s2">Bea beside her eating shrimp.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.183" end="00:20:28.785" style="s2">In the early evening, the big lakeside</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.105" end="00:20:32.145" style="s2">house is brightly lit [music] as Meg</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.785" end="00:20:32.145" style="s2">walks in with her purse.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.379" end="00:20:36.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.545" end="00:20:39.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg tries the study door and the keypad</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.865" end="00:20:39.665" style="s2">beeps red.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.545" end="00:20:50.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our anniversary.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.145" end="00:20:50.265" style="s2">He changed it today.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.265" end="00:20:56.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.625" end="00:20:58.345" style="s2">Dad called.</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.425" end="00:21:01.545" style="s2">He said you left upset. He said you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.345" end="00:21:01.545" style="s2">been confused lately.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.025" end="00:21:06.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Confused?</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.425" end="00:21:09.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said you&#39;ve been forgetting things.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.865" end="00:21:09.745" style="s2">That he&#39;s worried.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.065" end="00:21:15.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg asked, &quot;Claire, what did I forget?&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.785" end="00:21:22.185" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said you forgot to sign something</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.305" end="00:21:22.185" style="s2">important.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.665" end="00:21:29.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t forget, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.705" end="00:21:29.425" style="s2">I read it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.985" end="00:21:38.145" style="s2">My cards declined. All of them.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.585" end="00:21:43.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom?</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.774" end="00:21:46.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.825" end="00:21:49.585" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg,</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.305" end="00:21:52.425" style="s2">you embarrassed me in front of</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.585" end="00:21:52.425" style="s2">investors.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.585" end="00:21:59.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You called me your worst mistake before</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.665" end="00:22:02.465" style="s2">200 guests.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.265" end="00:22:02.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.425" end="00:22:12.065" style="s2">And you walked out on a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.225" end="00:22:12.065" style="s2">That&#39;s not normal behavior, Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.345" end="00:22:17.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You canceled my cards.</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.025" end="00:22:25.385" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company canceled the company cards.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.105" end="00:22:25.385" style="s2">You&#39;re not an employee.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.906" end="00:22:34.946" style="s2">Dr. Halpern can see you tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.306" end="00:22:34.946" style="s2">Just a checkup. Memory, stress.</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.146" end="00:22:41.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Mom doesn&#39;t need a doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.266" end="00:22:49.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, honey, let me handle this.</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.186" end="00:22:49.506" style="s2">You&#39;ve seen how she&#39;s been.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.026" end="00:22:57.346" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rick, is this about the proxy?</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.626" end="00:23:03.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s about your health.</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.786" end="00:23:06.786" style="s2">Sign the renewal tonight and we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.666" end="00:23:06.786" style="s2">forget the whole thing.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.226" end="00:23:13.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg picks up the family tablet from the</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.226" end="00:23:15.876" style="s2">kitchen island as it chimes.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.856" end="00:23:15.876" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.546" end="00:23:21.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A message preview with a red heart</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.386" end="00:23:23.626" style="s2">lights up the tablet in the hands of</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.146" end="00:23:23.626" style="s2">Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.666" end="00:23:31.541" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she signing?</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.906" end="00:23:32.426" style="s2">Condo&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.541" end="00:23:34.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.426" end="00:23:37.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t wait for 12:00.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.986" end="00:23:37.106" style="s2">Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.826" end="00:23:41.626" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s work.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.826" end="00:23:48.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.386" end="00:23:50.591" style="s2">who&#39;s Sienna?</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.571" end="00:23:50.591" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.666" end="00:23:57.586" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Event coordinator. It&#39;s about the merger</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.066" end="00:23:57.586" style="s2">party.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.666" end="00:24:05.586" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At 12:00.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.706" end="00:24:05.586" style="s2">At a condo.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.066" end="00:24:12.226" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg, I&#39;m going to the office. When I</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.626" end="00:24:15.786" style="s2">come back, I&#39;d like that signed or</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.226" end="00:24:15.786" style="s2">tomorrow we see Dr. Halpern.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.946" end="00:24:20.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard walks out to the garage.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.561" end="00:24:30.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.026" end="00:24:33.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.506" end="00:24:33.627" style="s2">is Dad cheating?</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.421" end="00:24:37.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.788" end="00:24:40.587" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.947" end="00:24:43.347" style="s2">But, I know he&#39;s lying about something.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.587" end="00:24:43.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do?</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.268" end="00:24:52.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We go to Aunt Bee&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.187" end="00:24:52.427" style="s2">And we read everything.</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.268" end="00:24:59.187" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa&#39;s thing?</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.312" end="00:25:02.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.627" end="00:25:05.587" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg and Claire walk out of the brightly</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.547" end="00:25:05.587" style="s2">lit house together.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.107" end="00:25:13.388" style="s2">The small yellow kitchen of the bungalow</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.107" end="00:25:15.747" style="s2">is brightly [music] lit late in the</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.388" end="00:25:17.652" style="s2">evening as Bee pours coffee over a table</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.747" end="00:25:19.672" style="s2">covered in papers.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.652" end="00:25:19.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.187" end="00:25:26.148" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 9:00. Everybody sit. Bee&#39;s war room is</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.668" end="00:25:26.148" style="s2">open.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.822" end="00:25:28.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.507" end="00:25:33.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good coffee, as promised.</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.307" end="00:25:43.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bee, it&#39;s 9:00. This had better be worth</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.427" end="00:25:43.547" style="s2">a missed bedtime.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.947" end="00:25:50.467" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Janet Pruitt, I typed [music] your bar</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.148" end="00:25:53.148" style="s2">application. Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.467" end="00:25:53.148" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.388" end="00:26:00.187" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg,</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.627" end="00:26:01.827" style="s2">Henry sent me the toast. I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.187" end="00:26:04.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.827" end="00:26:04.668" style="s2">Be my lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.028" end="00:26:07.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the company&#39;s lawyer,</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.778" end="00:26:10.148" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.307" end="00:26:12.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; which means I work for the shareholders.</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.148" end="00:26:14.693" style="s2">You&#39;re 51% of them.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.673" end="00:26:14.693" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.587" end="00:26:21.987" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He wants this signed by 12.</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.107" end="00:26:21.987" style="s2">Irrevocable.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.747" end="00:26:30.747" style="s2">This isn&#39;t a renewal.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.587" end="00:26:32.109" style="s2">It&#39;s a permanent transfer of your votes.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.747" end="00:26:34.629" style="s2">Your father would have thrown it in the</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.109" end="00:26:34.629" style="s2">lake.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.629" end="00:26:38.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if Mom doesn&#39;t sign?</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.309" end="00:26:44.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Janet said, &quot;Then at 12:01 the old proxy</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.803" end="00:26:46.949" style="s2">[music] expires.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.749" end="00:26:49.949" style="s2">Her shares vote again.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.949" end="00:26:49.949" style="s2">51%.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.829" end="00:26:55.248" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And there&#39;s something else.</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.029" end="00:26:55.269" style="s2">The Cartwright merger</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.248" end="00:26:56.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.269" end="00:26:59.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; isn&#39;t a merger.</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.869" end="00:26:59.709" style="s2">It&#39;s a sale.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.549" end="00:27:04.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A sale?</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.709" end="00:27:09.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Janet said, &quot;Cartwright buys the</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.709" end="00:27:11.429" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.109" end="00:27:13.789" style="s2">Rick gets a $20 million bonus and a</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.429" end="00:27:15.629" style="s2">board seat in Chicago.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.789" end="00:27:18.109" style="s2">The drivers&#39; pension gets folded into</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.629" end="00:27:18.109" style="s2">theirs.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.469" end="00:27:23.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The drivers.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.109" end="00:27:26.389" style="s2">Half of them drink at my bar.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.429" end="00:27:26.389" style="s2">Their pensions?</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.789" end="00:27:35.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cut by a third. It&#39;s in the term sheet.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.309" end="00:27:35.349" style="s2">He needed your proxy to sign it Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.869" end="00:27:41.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg [music] stands and walks to the</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.349" end="00:27:41.269" style="s2">kitchen window.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.109" end="00:27:51.949" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy started that pension with his own</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.109" end="00:27:54.869" style="s2">money in 1971.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.949" end="00:27:54.869" style="s2">Every driver.</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.789" end="00:28:00.229" style="s2">Your father drove the first truck</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.509" end="00:28:01.909" style="s2">himself.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.229" end="00:28:06.069" style="s2">With me in [music] the passenger seat</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.909" end="00:28:06.069" style="s2">typing invoices on my knee.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.709" end="00:28:12.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more thing. A penthouse condo on the</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.069" end="00:28:16.389" style="s2">corporate card. Rent, furniture, a car.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.709" end="00:28:16.389" style="s2">All in the name of Sienna Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.149" end="00:28:23.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The condo.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.389" end="00:28:23.349" style="s2">From the message.</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.469" end="00:28:30.229" style="s2">He&#39;s keeping his mistress [music] on</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.029" end="00:28:34.270" style="s2">Daddy&#39;s company card.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.229" end="00:28:34.270" style="s2">And I am going to put a stop to it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.990" end="00:28:41.310" style="s2">That&#39;s not an affair, Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.190" end="00:28:41.310" style="s2">That&#39;s embezzlement.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.350" end="00:28:47.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Janet,</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.150" end="00:28:51.390" style="s2">what do I do?</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.230" end="00:28:51.390" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. [music] Step by step.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.230" end="00:28:57.430" style="s2">One, don&#39;t sign.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.270" end="00:28:59.990" style="s2">Two, at 12:01 you deliver a written</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.430" end="00:29:03.670" style="s2">revocation. Three, you call an emergency</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.990" end="00:29:03.670" style="s2">board meeting 7:00 a.m.</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.670" end="00:29:09.070" style="s2">Seven.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.030" end="00:29:09.070" style="s2">By sunrise.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.190" end="00:29:20.190" style="s2">By sunrise.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.350" end="00:29:20.190" style="s2">And Meg, the board votes on the CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.710" end="00:29:25.910" style="s2">Then the board votes.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.390" end="00:29:32.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Meg,</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.710" end="00:29:33.910" style="s2">the drivers have a union steward,</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.350" end="00:29:36.950" style="s2">Big Earl.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.910" end="00:29:36.950" style="s2">He&#39;ll want to be there.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.710" end="00:29:44.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call him, Henry.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.710" end="00:29:44.150" style="s2">They deserve to see it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.750" end="00:29:51.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I&#39;ll type the revocation.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.070" end="00:29:54.670" style="s2">1959 Royal. Never lost [music] a</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.750" end="00:29:54.670" style="s2">document.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.550" end="00:30:01.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bea, we have printers.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.235" end="00:30:06.830" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.830" end="00:30:10.030" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Printers jam.</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.830" end="00:30:10.030" style="s2">Royals don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.095" end="00:30:13.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.350" end="00:30:19.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what about Dad?</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.910" end="00:30:19.310" style="s2">He&#39;s going to be furious.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.390" end="00:30:28.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father called me his worst mistake</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.350" end="00:30:28.150" style="s2">before 200 guests, Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.746" end="00:30:35.790" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.230" end="00:30:35.790" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s make sure he&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.606" end="00:30:43.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.512" end="00:30:43.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your grandmother would have liked you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.632" end="00:30:49.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The old typewriter keys strike as the</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.672" end="00:30:49.952" style="s2">fingers of B fly.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.832" end="00:31:01.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Revocation of proxy, ready for signature</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.872" end="00:31:03.551" style="s2">at 12:01.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.531" end="00:31:03.551" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.952" end="00:31:08.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The brightly lit little kitchen glows as</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.912" end="00:31:10.632" style="s2">Meg, B, Janet, [music] Henry, and Claire</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.832" end="00:31:13.312" style="s2">sit around the table with coffee and</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.632" end="00:31:13.312" style="s2">papers.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.592" end="00:31:17.251" style="s2">The small front porch of the bungalow is</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.392" end="00:31:18.472" style="s2">brightly lit by a porch lamp and strings</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.251" end="00:31:20.072" style="s2">[music] of white bulbs late in the</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.472" end="00:31:22.872" style="s2">evening as Richard walks up the steps</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.072" end="00:31:22.872" style="s2">holding a folder.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.472" end="00:31:26.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.832" end="00:31:32.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg, can we talk?</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.351" end="00:31:34.872" style="s2">Just us.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.872" end="00:31:37.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt B&#39;s listening through the window.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.872" end="00:31:37.952" style="s2">She always does.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.712" end="00:31:43.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evening, Richard.</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.106" end="00:31:46.126" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.231" end="00:31:53.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Meg, Meg, I came to apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.592" end="00:31:53.832" style="s2">The joke went too far.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.752" end="00:32:01.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t a joke, Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.592" end="00:32:01.992" style="s2">You meant every word.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.312" end="00:32:07.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I brought you something.</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.032" end="00:32:09.432" style="s2">The deed to the lake house.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.992" end="00:32:11.072" style="s2">In your name.</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.432" end="00:32:13.712" style="s2">And a check.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.072" end="00:32:13.712" style="s2">2 million.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.192" end="00:32:17.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For what?</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.112" end="00:32:24.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For your signature. The proxy.</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.952" end="00:32:26.672" style="s2">Before 12. Then you have the [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.752" end="00:32:27.912" style="s2">lake, the money,</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.672" end="00:32:30.392" style="s2">and you never deal with the company</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.912" end="00:32:30.392" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.872" end="00:32:34.272" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the drivers&#39; pensions?</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.392" end="00:32:41.953" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you about pensions?</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.153" end="00:32:50.073" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Read everything before you sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.273" end="00:32:50.073" style="s2">Daddy&#39;s rule.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.513" end="00:32:53.873" style="s2">I read your term sheet.</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.913" end="00:32:57.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then read this.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.433" end="00:33:00.553" style="s2">If you don&#39;t sign, Dr. Halperin files a</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.393" end="00:33:03.793" style="s2">capacity report. Confused, erratic,</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.553" end="00:33:03.793" style="s2">walked out of her own party.</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.433" end="00:33:10.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire was there.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.553" end="00:33:10.633" style="s2">Henry filmed it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.673" end="00:33:16.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bartender&#39;s phone against a doctor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.673" end="00:33:19.793" style="s2">letter?</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.033" end="00:33:19.793" style="s2">Meg, be smart.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.193" end="00:33:25.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg closes the folder and hands it back</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.473" end="00:33:25.913" style="s2">to him.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.943" end="00:33:28.963" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.233" end="00:33:36.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your lake house, Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.193" end="00:33:39.393" style="s2">My father isn&#39;t for sale.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.233" end="00:33:39.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll regret this.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.673" end="00:33:45.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s 11:59.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.153" end="00:33:52.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So?</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.153" end="00:34:01.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, in 1 minute, you&#39;ll find out what I</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.553" end="00:34:01.273" style="s2">regret.</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.873" end="00:34:08.193" style="s2">12:01, Maggie.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.433" end="00:34:11.233" style="s2">Read it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.193" end="00:34:11.233" style="s2">Then sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.593" end="00:34:17.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg reads the typed page under the porch</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.873" end="00:34:17.313" style="s2">light.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.793" end="00:34:25.513" style="s2">The hand of Meg signs her name at the</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.633" end="00:34:27.858" style="s2">bottom of the typed revocation with an</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.513" end="00:34:29.878" style="s2">old fountain pen.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.858" end="00:34:29.878" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.593" end="00:34:39.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Revocation of proxy [music] delivered to</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.393" end="00:34:41.674" style="s2">Richard Harlow at 12:01. Witnessed.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.313" end="00:34:44.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard asked &quot;Janet,</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.674" end="00:34:44.394" style="s2">you&#39;re here.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.554" end="00:34:48.674" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the company&#39;s lawyer, Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.834" end="00:34:50.674" style="s2">The majority shareholder just called an</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.674" end="00:34:53.634" style="s2">emergency board meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.674" end="00:34:53.634" style="s2">7:00 a.m.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.834" end="00:34:59.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t do that.</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.394" end="00:35:04.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Janet said, &quot;Notice of meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.194" end="00:35:07.874" style="s2">You&#39;re served.</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.914" end="00:35:09.994" style="s2">Bring the term sheet.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.874" end="00:35:11.394" style="s2">Richard backs down the steps crumpling</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.994" end="00:35:13.874" style="s2">the notice and marches [music] to his</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.394" end="00:35:13.874" style="s2">car.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.034" end="00:35:21.574" style="s2">On the brightly lit porch, Meg, B,</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.634" end="00:35:24.314" style="s2">Janet, and Henry watch his car pull</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.574" end="00:35:24.314" style="s2">[music] away.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.314" end="00:35:30.554" style="s2">In a sleek penthouse brightly lit with</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.314" end="00:35:32.754" style="s2">every lamp on, Sienna in an ivory silk</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.554" end="00:35:35.324" style="s2">robe pours champagne, a string of old</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.754" end="00:35:37.344" style="s2">pearls on her neck.</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.324" end="00:35:37.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.834" end="00:35:43.834" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She revoked it. 12:01, her lawyer was on</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.114" end="00:35:43.834" style="s2">the porch.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.149" end="00:35:48.474" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.594" end="00:35:51.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her lawyer?</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.474" end="00:35:51.994" style="s2">I thought Janet was yours.</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.354" end="00:36:00.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Janet was her father&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.314" end="00:36:00.994" style="s2">I should have fired her years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.874" end="00:36:08.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, the merger&#39;s off?</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.914" end="00:36:15.434" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not if I hold the board. Five directors.</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.514" end="00:36:19.234" style="s2">I appointed three of them.</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.434" end="00:36:19.234" style="s2">At 7:00, they vote with me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.234" end="00:36:24.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Meg&#39;s 51%?</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.954" end="00:36:34.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shareholders elect the board in March.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.554" end="00:36:37.154" style="s2">Until then, the board runs the company.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.154" end="00:36:37.154" style="s2">My board.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.674" end="00:36:42.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, she owns it,</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.634" end="00:36:42.754" style="s2">but you run it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.636" end="00:36:50.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. And by March, Cartwright owns</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.636" end="00:36:50.916" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.636" end="00:36:56.436" style="s2">Dr. Halpern,</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.076" end="00:36:57.996" style="s2">I need [music] that capacity letter by</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.436" end="00:36:59.036" style="s2">6:00.</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.996" end="00:37:01.130" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.036" end="00:37:03.036" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay double.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.130" end="00:37:04.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.036" end="00:37:07.596" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rick,</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.916" end="00:37:10.476" style="s2">these pearls you gave me,</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.596" end="00:37:10.476" style="s2">they&#39;re old.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.596" end="00:37:17.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re antique, very valuable.</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.996" end="00:37:24.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s an engraving on the clasp.</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.756" end="00:37:25.956" style="s2">A L</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.276" end="00:37:28.956" style="s2">to I L</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.956" end="00:37:28.956" style="s2">1965.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.276" end="00:37:34.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry about it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.501" end="00:37:39.876" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.116" end="00:37:42.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A L Arne Lindquist,</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.876" end="00:37:45.356" style="s2">Meg&#39;s father.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.156" end="00:37:45.356" style="s2">These were her mother&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.396" end="00:37:51.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard said, &quot;Meg never wore them.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.476" end="00:37:53.531" style="s2">Someone should.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.236" end="00:37:55.551" style="s2">Sienna slowly takes off the pearls.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.531" end="00:37:55.551" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.081" end="00:38:02.356" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.876" end="00:38:04.996" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me you were divorcing her in</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.356" end="00:38:06.396" style="s2">June, then September.</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.996" end="00:38:09.306" style="s2">Now you&#39;re giving me her mother giving</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.396" end="00:38:09.306" style="s2">me her mother&#39;s pearls? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.476" end="00:38:14.956" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna, not tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.236" end="00:38:22.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna asked, &quot;And the condo?</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.116" end="00:38:22.356" style="s2">Is the condo yours?&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.556" end="00:38:28.956" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the company&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.276" end="00:38:28.956" style="s2">Same thing.</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.116" end="00:38:33.876" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same thing.</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.596" end="00:38:35.436" style="s2">That&#39;s what you said about the merger</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.876" end="00:38:37.316" style="s2">bonus.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.436" end="00:38:40.316" style="s2">Same thing. That&#39;s what you said about</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.316" end="00:38:40.316" style="s2">the merger bonus.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.916" end="00:38:48.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You live here rent-free, you drive a</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.236" end="00:38:48.757" style="s2">free car, and you&#39;re asking questions?</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.197" end="00:38:53.837" style="s2">Sienna looks at him differently.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.357" end="00:39:03.557" style="s2">Sienna quietly turns her phone face down</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.717" end="00:39:04.927" style="s2">on the counter, its screen still</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.557" end="00:39:06.947" style="s2">recording.</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.927" end="00:39:06.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.637" end="00:39:13.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At 7:00, you&#39;ll be at the meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.157" end="00:39:15.277" style="s2">You&#39;ll say Meg was hysterical at the</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.877" end="00:39:18.677" style="s2">party.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.277" end="00:39:18.677" style="s2">Under oath if you have to.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.317" end="00:39:22.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Under oath?</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.637" end="00:39:25.237" style="s2">I didn&#39;t think we were playing by those</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.877" end="00:39:26.597" style="s2">rules tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.237" end="00:39:29.157" style="s2">But if you really want the truth, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.597" end="00:39:29.157" style="s2">tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.437" end="00:39:33.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want the Chicago job or not?</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.917" end="00:39:34.957" style="s2">Coordinator to Cartwright vice</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.597" end="00:39:38.397" style="s2">president.</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.957" end="00:39:38.397" style="s2">That&#39;s what loyalty buys.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.757" end="00:39:43.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Loyalty.</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.597" end="00:39:52.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get some sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.357" end="00:39:52.677" style="s2">Wear something serious.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.117" end="00:39:58.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard walks into the bedroom with his</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.917" end="00:39:58.917" style="s2">phone to his ear.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.517" end="00:40:08.277" style="s2">Sienna picks up her phone and stops the</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.637" end="00:40:08.277" style="s2">recording.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.427" end="00:40:12.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.957" end="00:40:18.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The recording timer on the phone of</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.597" end="00:40:18.317" style="s2">Sienna shows 11 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.872" end="00:40:27.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.117" end="00:40:27.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His wife&#39;s mother&#39;s pearls.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.277" end="00:40:34.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna lays the pearls in a small velvet</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.557" end="00:40:34.117" style="s2">box.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.237" end="00:40:45.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father bought these, Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.597" end="00:40:45.237" style="s2">Not him.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.437" end="00:40:48.757" style="s2">To Meg Harlow,</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.418" end="00:40:50.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.757" end="00:40:51.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 7:00 a.m.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.158" end="00:40:54.518" style="s2">I&#39;ll be there. I have something of</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.958" end="00:40:54.518" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.998" end="00:41:01.278" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The thumb of Sienna hovers over send,</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.278" end="00:41:01.278" style="s2">then presses it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.173" end="00:41:04.193" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.358" end="00:41:08.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna sits alone at the counter of the</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.318" end="00:41:11.198" style="s2">brightly lit penthouse holding the</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.998" end="00:41:13.878" style="s2">velvet box as the city glitters beyond</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.198" end="00:41:13.878" style="s2">the glass.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.798" end="00:41:18.278" style="s2">Golden sunrise light floods a modern</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.583" end="00:41:20.358" style="s2">[music] boardroom at the Freight Company</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.278" end="00:41:22.478" style="s2">as Meg in a navy suit sits at the head</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.358" end="00:41:24.498" style="s2">of the long table.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.478" end="00:41:24.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.598" end="00:41:32.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five directors confirmed.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.758" end="00:41:32.678" style="s2">Two of them were your father&#39;s friends.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.918" end="00:41:40.718" style="s2">I brought coffee and my typewriter,</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.718" end="00:41:40.718" style="s2">just in case.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.678" end="00:41:49.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Meg,</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.198" end="00:41:49.198" style="s2">Big Earl and the morning drivers.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.718" end="00:41:56.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, you&#39;re in a suit.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.238" end="00:41:57.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First time since my wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.238" end="00:41:59.869" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell my wife it still fits.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.849" end="00:41:59.869" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.278" end="00:42:06.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.198" end="00:42:06.518" style="s2">I&#39;m here. I&#39;m with you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.278" end="00:42:12.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit by Aunt B.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.358" end="00:42:15.878" style="s2">She bites. I know.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.358" end="00:42:21.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard strides in wearing a pinstripe</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.318" end="00:42:24.918" style="s2">suit with three directors and stops when</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.438" end="00:42:24.918" style="s2">he sees Meg in his chair.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.198" end="00:42:32.678" style="s2">Meg,</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.718" end="00:42:32.678" style="s2">that&#39;s my chair.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.798" end="00:42:40.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was my father&#39;s chair, Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.518" end="00:42:40.678" style="s2">You were borrowing it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.598" end="00:42:50.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This board runs the company until March.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.158" end="00:42:50.238" style="s2">Three of these five directors are mine.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.958" end="00:42:57.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two, as of 6:00 a.m., Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.640" end="00:43:04.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.320" end="00:43:10.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Director Haskins resigned at 6:00.</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.680" end="00:43:13.680" style="s2">Conflict of interest. He was promised a</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.960" end="00:43:15.360" style="s2">Cartwright consulting contract.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.680" end="00:43:17.759" style="s2">It&#39;s in the term sheet.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.360" end="00:43:19.779" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard goes pale.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.759" end="00:43:19.779" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.345" end="00:43:24.365" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.400" end="00:43:29.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This emergency meeting is called by the</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.240" end="00:43:31.040" style="s2">majority shareholder.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.400" end="00:43:32.640" style="s2">Item one,</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.040" end="00:43:35.440" style="s2">the proposed sale to Cartwright</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.640" end="00:43:35.440" style="s2">Logistics.</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.680" end="00:43:38.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Merger.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.160" end="00:43:42.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sale.</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.320" end="00:43:45.800" style="s2">Page three,</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.800" end="00:43:50.080" style="s2">a $20 million bonus to Richard Harlow.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.800" end="00:43:50.080" style="s2">Driver pensions cut by 34%.</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.000" end="00:43:56.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.880" end="00:43:56.880" style="s2">34%.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.480" end="00:44:06.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 34% of a man&#39;s retirement for one man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.360" end="00:44:06.920" style="s2">boat.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.960" end="00:44:13.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a standard restructuring.</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.160" end="00:44:16.480" style="s2">The market is brutal.</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.200" end="00:44:16.480" style="s2">The drivers will be fine.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.560" end="00:44:22.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rick, my father drove the first truck</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.600" end="00:44:24.480" style="s2">himself. He started that pension with</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.720" end="00:44:27.480" style="s2">his own money.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.480" end="00:44:27.480" style="s2">1971.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.640" end="00:44:34.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father&#39;s gone, Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.760" end="00:44:34.560" style="s2">Sentiment doesn&#39;t move freight.</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.960" end="00:44:40.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.440" end="00:44:41.920" style="s2">Drivers move freight.</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.600" end="00:44:44.440" style="s2">And you just told them what they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.920" end="00:44:44.440" style="s2">worth.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.640" end="00:44:50.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before we vote on anything,</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.120" end="00:44:52.520" style="s2">the board should know about my wife&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.880" end="00:44:55.921" style="s2">condition.</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.520" end="00:44:55.921" style="s2">Dr. Halpern has a letter.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.361" end="00:45:01.081" style="s2">Confusion. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.201" end="00:45:02.841" style="s2">Emotional instability.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.081" end="00:45:04.526" style="s2">Yesterday she walked out of her own</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.841" end="00:45:06.546" style="s2">anniversary party.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.526" end="00:45:06.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.361" end="00:45:13.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you called her your worst</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.921" end="00:45:13.481" style="s2">mistake before 200 guests.</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.201" end="00:45:21.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.721" end="00:45:21.561" style="s2">You&#39;re upset.</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.561" end="00:45:30.041" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.401" end="00:45:30.041" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.521" end="00:45:37.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry sets his phone on the table and</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.401" end="00:45:37.201" style="s2">connects it to the big wall screen.</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.481" end="00:45:46.241" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marrying you was my worst mistake, Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.321" end="00:45:47.756" style="s2">Her daddy&#39;s company was the only good</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.241" end="00:45:49.776" style="s2">part.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.756" end="00:45:49.776" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.961" end="00:45:56.441" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And next week we merge with Cartwright</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.601" end="00:45:58.891" style="s2">Logistics. My name on every truck in</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.441" end="00:46:00.911" style="s2">America.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.891" end="00:46:00.911" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.361" end="00:46:06.881" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His name on my brother&#39;s trucks.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.761" end="00:46:12.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.641" end="00:46:12.801" style="s2">Everyone laughed.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.081" end="00:46:20.761" style="s2">Not everyone, Mr. Harlow.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.761" end="00:46:20.761" style="s2">I was pouring.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.881" end="00:46:26.841" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And this letter</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.361" end="00:46:28.841" style="s2">dated today 5:50 a.m.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.841" end="00:46:33.241" style="s2">Dr. Halpern has never examined Meg</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.841" end="00:46:33.241" style="s2">Harlow. He told me so himself at 6:00.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.201" end="00:46:37.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not true.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.441" end="00:46:42.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Janet [music] said his invoice went to</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.401" end="00:46:43.801" style="s2">Harlow Freight.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.201" end="00:46:46.921" style="s2">Double rate.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.801" end="00:46:46.921" style="s2">Approved by you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.841" end="00:46:52.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Janet, you&#39;re fired.</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.681" end="00:46:59.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Janet said, &quot;You can&#39;t fire me, Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.243" end="00:47:01.523" style="s2">I report to the directors.</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.642" end="00:47:03.563" style="s2">And the directors are about to report on</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.523" end="00:47:06.122" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.563" end="00:47:07.843" style="s2">Janet said, &quot;Item two,</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.122" end="00:47:11.122" style="s2">corporate card,</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.843" end="00:47:13.003" style="s2">a penthouse condo, 18 months,</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.122" end="00:47:14.563" style="s2">a car lease,</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.003" end="00:47:17.483" style="s2">furniture,</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.563" end="00:47:20.822" style="s2">$311,000,</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.483" end="00:47:20.822" style="s2">all for Sienna Veil.&quot; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.162" end="00:47:27.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s an employee.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.563" end="00:47:27.642" style="s2">Housing allowance.</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.003" end="00:47:36.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Housing allowance?</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.083" end="00:47:36.602" style="s2">Is that what they call it now?</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.142" end="00:47:42.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.043" end="00:47:42.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire looks at her father in disgust.</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.402" end="00:47:51.553" style="s2">The boardroom doors open and Sienna</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.243" end="00:47:55.563" style="s2">walks in wearing a pale gray pantsuit</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.553" end="00:47:55.563" style="s2">[music] holding a small velvet box.</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.763" end="00:48:00.483" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.402" end="00:48:01.602" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.483" end="00:48:05.723" style="s2">Tell them.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.602" end="00:48:05.723" style="s2">Tell them how Meg behaved yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.003" end="00:48:13.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll tell them what I heard last night</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.563" end="00:48:13.162" style="s2">instead.</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.122" end="00:48:19.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.922" end="00:48:26.763" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 11 minutes last night.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.563" end="00:48:28.122" style="s2">He told me to lie under oath</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.763" end="00:48:31.122" style="s2">about Meg</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.122" end="00:48:33.162" style="s2">for a job in Chicago.</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.122" end="00:48:34.783" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard lunges for the phone and Janet</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.162" end="00:48:36.803" style="s2">covers it with her hand.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.783" end="00:48:36.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.922" end="00:48:44.682" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said the condo and the company were</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.723" end="00:48:46.843" style="s2">the same thing.</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.682" end="00:48:49.803" style="s2">They&#39;re not, Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.843" end="00:48:49.803" style="s2">And neither am I.</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.763" end="00:48:53.602" style="s2">Mrs. Harlow,</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.162" end="00:48:55.122" style="s2">these are yours.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.602" end="00:48:58.362" style="s2">He gave them to me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.122" end="00:48:58.362" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know whose they were.</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.018" end="00:49:02.084" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.803" end="00:49:04.164" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hands of Meg open the box to reveal</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.084" end="00:49:04.913" style="s2">a string of old pearls with an engraved</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.164" end="00:49:06.933" style="s2">clasp.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.913" end="00:49:06.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.124" end="00:49:16.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother&#39;s [music] pearls.</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.284" end="00:49:18.724" style="s2">Daddy gave them to her in 1965.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.703" end="00:49:18.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.404" end="00:49:24.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Sienna.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.404" end="00:49:32.004" style="s2">Don&#39;t thank me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.844" end="00:49:34.964" style="s2">I was wrong about a lot of things.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.004" end="00:49:34.964" style="s2">He was one of them.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.844" end="00:49:40.404" style="s2">Motion one.</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.564" end="00:49:42.884" style="s2">Reject the Cartwright sale. All in</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.404" end="00:49:42.884" style="s2">favor?</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.364" end="00:49:48.044" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg and four directors raise their hands</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.684" end="00:49:50.444" style="s2">as the drivers watch [music] from the</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.044" end="00:49:50.444" style="s2">wall.</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.684" end="00:49:57.644" style="s2">Janet said, &quot;Five to nothing.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.404" end="00:50:04.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Motion two. Richard Harlow as chief</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.444" end="00:50:05.564" style="s2">executive for cause and refer the</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.124" end="00:50:08.124" style="s2">expense records to the district</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.564" end="00:50:08.124" style="s2">attorney.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.284" end="00:50:14.364" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t do this.</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.004" end="00:50:14.364" style="s2">I built this company.</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.604" end="00:50:23.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You renamed it, Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.284" end="00:50:23.324" style="s2">Daddy built it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.444" end="00:50:30.284" style="s2">All in favor?</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.884" end="00:50:35.364" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Four directors raise their hands as</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.644" end="00:50:39.164" style="s2">Richard sits frozen at the side [music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.364" end="00:50:39.164" style="s2">of the table and the drivers cheer.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.164" end="00:50:45.130" style="s2">In bright morning sunshine, Meg walks</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.324" end="00:50:47.124" style="s2">out onto a truck yard full of big</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.130" end="00:50:49.604" style="s2">[music] rigs as drivers in work jackets</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.124" end="00:50:49.604" style="s2">gather.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.524" end="00:50:56.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Meg, they want to hear it from you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.884" end="00:51:02.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your pensions stay exactly where my</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.804" end="00:51:06.325" style="s2">father put them.</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.405" end="00:51:06.325" style="s2">Nobody is selling [music] this company.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.205" end="00:51:11.685" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The drivers cheer and honk their truck</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.020" end="00:51:14.445" style="s2">[music] horns across the sunny yard</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.685" end="00:51:14.445" style="s2">around May.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.260" end="00:51:17.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.685" end="00:51:26.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 1959 I wrote in the first one of these.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.445" end="00:51:26.405" style="s2">Typed invoices on my knee.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.765" end="00:51:33.965" style="s2">Somebody help me down.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.925" end="00:51:33.965" style="s2">My knees are older than the trucks.</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.530" end="00:51:39.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.805" end="00:51:42.825" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.205" end="00:51:48.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Harlow Freight.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.845" end="00:51:48.525" style="s2">That sign comes down today.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.125" end="00:51:57.845" style="s2">What goes up</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.645" end="00:51:57.845" style="s2">must COME DOWN.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.490" end="00:52:00.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.685" end="00:52:06.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LINDQUIST FREIGHT, LIKE IT WAS.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.565" end="00:52:06.365" style="s2">Grandpa&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.685" end="00:52:12.165" style="s2">Grandpa&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.405" end="00:52:14.805" style="s2">And yours someday, if you read</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.165" end="00:52:14.805" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.176" end="00:52:19.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.285" end="00:52:21.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.205" end="00:52:23.285" style="s2">Yesterday, when Dad said you were</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.125" end="00:52:24.691" style="s2">confused,</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.285" end="00:52:26.125" style="s2">I almost believed him.</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.691" end="00:52:29.085" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.125" end="00:52:31.241" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May said, &quot;He&#39;s very convincing. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.085" end="00:52:32.551" style="s2">That&#39;s how he got 30 years.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.241" end="00:52:32.645" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.551" end="00:52:34.085" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.645" end="00:52:36.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard walks out of the building</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.085" end="00:52:39.205" style="s2">carrying a cardboard box beside a</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.125" end="00:52:39.205" style="s2">security guard.</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.756" end="00:52:41.776" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.485" end="00:52:45.645" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May.</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.645" end="00:52:47.365" style="s2">30 years.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.645" end="00:52:49.581" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years, Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.365" end="00:52:51.601" style="s2">And one joke.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.581" end="00:52:51.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.005" end="00:52:57.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happens to me?</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.805" end="00:53:02.485" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your contract has a severance. The</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.005" end="00:53:03.685" style="s2">district attorney has your expense</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.485" end="00:53:05.367" style="s2">reports.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.685" end="00:53:08.167" style="s2">And the lake house is mine. It [music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.367" end="00:53:08.167" style="s2">always was.</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.887" end="00:53:12.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to take everything?</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.207" end="00:53:18.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.567" end="00:53:20.087" style="s2">I&#39;m taking back what you took.</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.527" end="00:53:23.447" style="s2">There&#39;s a difference.</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.087" end="00:53:23.447" style="s2">Daddy taught me to read it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.952" end="00:53:26.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.567" end="00:53:31.887" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bee said, &quot;Richard,</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.502" end="00:53:34.687" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.887" end="00:53:38.167" style="s2">&gt;&gt; marrying you was your first mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.687" end="00:53:38.167" style="s2">But the company made up for it.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.707" end="00:53:40.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.982" end="00:53:44.657" style="s2">[cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.637" end="00:53:44.657" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.887" end="00:53:49.687" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Bee.</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.607" end="00:53:57.567" style="s2">The board voted you interim CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.367" end="00:54:00.087" style="s2">Four to nothing. Haskins&#39; chair is</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.567" end="00:54:00.087" style="s2">empty.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.887" end="00:54:04.487" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interim?</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.927" end="00:54:11.167" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Until you decide.</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.007" end="00:54:14.287" style="s2">You could hire someone</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.167" end="00:54:14.287" style="s2">or run it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.567" end="00:54:22.367" style="s2">Daddy drove the first one.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.647" end="00:54:22.367" style="s2">I think I&#39;ll read the rest myself.</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.127" end="00:54:28.167" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll draft it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.767" end="00:54:33.927" style="s2">Henry,</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.007" end="00:54:36.807" style="s2">you saved [music] my father&#39;s company</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.927" end="00:54:36.807" style="s2">with a phone.</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.967" end="00:54:42.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause and cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.207" end="00:54:44.687" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just poured drinks and paid attention,</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.047" end="00:54:44.687" style="s2">Miss Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.727" end="00:54:50.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve poured drinks at that club for 32</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.087" end="00:54:52.807" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.647" end="00:54:55.447" style="s2">What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.807" end="00:54:55.447" style="s2">Anything.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.767" end="00:54:59.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honestly?</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.167" end="00:55:01.807" style="s2">My own little bar</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.927" end="00:55:05.087" style="s2">down by the docks</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.807" end="00:55:05.087" style="s2">where the drivers drink.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.128" end="00:55:07.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.927" end="00:55:08.768" style="s2">Then it&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.367" end="00:55:13.028" style="s2">The company owns a building on the</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.768" end="00:55:15.048" style="s2">docks. It&#39;s been empty since &#39;98.</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.028" end="00:55:15.048" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.928" end="00:55:20.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Meg, I can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.368" end="00:55:28.808" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Read everything before you sign it. The</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.328" end="00:55:28.808" style="s2">lease is a dollar a year.</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.403" end="00:55:32.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.488" end="00:55:34.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forever.</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.023" end="00:55:34.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.288" end="00:55:40.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forever? Your father would have tipped</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.648" end="00:55:41.408" style="s2">50 for that.</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.538" end="00:55:43.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.408" end="00:55:46.288" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want the first stool.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.568" end="00:55:48.128" style="s2">The one by the window.</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.288" end="00:55:51.488" style="s2">I&#39;m 84.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.128" end="00:55:51.488" style="s2">I&#39;ve earned the window.</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.888" end="00:55:57.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The window stool The window stool is</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.848" end="00:55:59.588" style="s2">yours for life.</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.568" end="00:55:59.588" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.768" end="00:56:06.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, at my age, that&#39;s not a long</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.128" end="00:56:08.758" style="s2">lease.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.738" end="00:56:08.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.048" end="00:56:15.248" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sunny truck yard roars with honking</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.088" end="00:56:19.608" style="s2">horns as Meg, B, Claire, Henry, and</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.248" end="00:56:19.608" style="s2">Janet stand together under the old sign.</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.768" end="00:56:23.728" style="s2">One week later on a sunny afternoon,</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.808" end="00:56:25.408" style="s2">Henry unlocks the door of a small</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.728" end="00:56:29.248" style="s2">dockside bar with a freshly [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.408" end="00:56:29.248" style="s2">painted sign as Driver&#39;s Cheer.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.974" end="00:56:34.008" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.808" end="00:56:35.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My own taps.</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.008" end="00:56:35.568" style="s2">32 years</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.559" end="00:56:36.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.568" end="00:56:38.889" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and they&#39;re mine.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.869" end="00:56:38.889" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.208" end="00:56:45.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Window stool, reserved. B. Lindquist,</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.688" end="00:56:45.439" style="s2">lifetime. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.528" end="00:56:52.688" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First drink of the house, Miss B. On the</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.008" end="00:56:54.568" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.688" end="00:56:58.008" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, [music] everything should be on</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.568" end="00:56:58.008" style="s2">the house at my age.</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.128" end="00:57:02.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, [music] I brought something for</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.808" end="00:57:02.448" style="s2">the wall.</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.724" end="00:57:05.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.848" end="00:57:08.089" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The framed photo in the hands of Meg</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.968" end="00:57:09.619" style="s2">shows a young man beside an old freight</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.089" end="00:57:11.639" style="s2">truck.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.619" end="00:57:11.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.729" end="00:57:18.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Arnie,</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.169" end="00:57:20.809" style="s2">right where he can watch the drivers.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.789" end="00:57:20.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.169" end="00:57:26.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right where he can watch you pour.</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.769" end="00:57:32.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.009" end="00:57:35.729" style="s2">first [music] day at the yard. They put</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.649" end="00:57:35.729" style="s2">me on the loading dock.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.049" end="00:57:41.449" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The loading dock? You have a business</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.169" end="00:57:42.969" style="s2">degree.</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.449" end="00:57:45.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa said start where the freight</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.969" end="00:57:47.664" style="s2">starts. Aunt Bee told me.</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.644" end="00:57:47.664" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.849" end="00:57:52.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somebody in this family has to listen to</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.209" end="00:57:54.869" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.849" end="00:57:54.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.929" end="00:58:00.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Bee,</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.609" end="00:58:02.730" style="s2">we all listen.</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.710" end="00:58:02.730" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.689" end="00:58:09.889" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg,</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.009" end="00:58:12.689" style="s2">two things. Came back. And Siena Vale</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.889" end="00:58:12.689" style="s2">sent a letter.</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.609" end="00:58:18.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Siena?</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.085" end="00:58:20.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.395" end="00:58:22.689" style="s2">[applause and cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.249" end="00:58:24.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s taken a job in Denver.</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.689" end="00:58:26.169" style="s2">She says she&#39;s sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.969" end="00:58:29.449" style="s2">And she says the [music] pearls look</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.169" end="00:58:29.449" style="s2">better on the right woman.</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.609" end="00:58:34.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg touches the pearls at her neck.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.805" end="00:58:34.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.649" end="00:58:43.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell her thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.689" end="00:58:47.289" style="s2">And give her a good reference. She told</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.849" end="00:58:47.289" style="s2">the truth when it cost her.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.569" end="00:58:56.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Rick signed.</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.249" end="00:58:56.609" style="s2">He wants you to know he read every page.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.660" end="00:59:05.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.649" end="00:59:05.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every page? That&#39;s a first.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.140" end="00:59:12.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.729" end="00:59:16.691" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years. Read first,</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.691" end="00:59:19.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.691" end="00:59:19.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; then signed.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.851" end="00:59:28.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, a round for round for the room.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.515" end="00:59:28.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.791" end="00:59:31.811" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.066" end="00:59:36.996" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.171" end="00:59:39.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First round&#39;s on Lindquist Freight.</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.996" end="00:59:39.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.931" end="00:59:43.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The little bar erupts in cheers as</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.811" end="00:59:46.091" style="s2">drivers raise their glasses around</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.546" end="00:59:46.091" style="s2">[music] Meg.</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.406" end="00:59:53.426" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.411" end="00:59:58.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg notices him through the window.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.576" end="01:00:02.596" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.051" end="01:00:14.411" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg,</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.131" end="01:00:15.811" style="s2">I&#39;m here to apologize</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.411" end="01:00:19.091" style="s2">for the toast.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.811" end="01:00:19.091" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I read your letter, too.</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.226" end="01:00:23.811" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.411" end="01:00:25.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.811" end="01:00:27.531" style="s2">I was jealous of a man who wasn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.651" end="01:00:31.211" style="s2">alive,</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.531" end="01:00:31.211" style="s2">of his name on every truck.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.491" end="01:00:37.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could have earned your own name.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.931" end="01:00:37.911" style="s2">You just had to read the fine print.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.256" end="01:00:39.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.911" end="01:00:39.932" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.971" end="01:00:44.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father&#39;s line.</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.462" end="01:00:46.482" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.651" end="01:00:51.571" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My line now.</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.051" end="01:00:59.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I come in?</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.971" end="01:01:01.547" style="s2">One drink?</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.527" end="01:01:01.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.422" end="01:01:10.211" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.851" end="01:01:10.211" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Henry&#39;s call. It&#39;s his bar.</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.451" end="01:01:16.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Harlow,</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.011" end="01:01:18.052" style="s2">you can have a club soda.</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.132" end="01:01:20.542" style="s2">Last stool</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.052" end="01:01:20.542" style="s2">beside the drivers. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.852" end="01:01:27.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s fair.</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.727" end="01:01:27.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.932" end="01:01:34.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard walks in and sits at the far end</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.092" end="01:01:34.012" style="s2">of the bar as drivers glance at him.</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.532" end="01:01:42.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You let him in?</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.092" end="01:01:44.652" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I did. He deserves a chance.</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.452" end="01:01:48.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, let&#39;s hope he behaves himself.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.652" end="01:01:50.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He will, Auntie. He will.</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.212" end="01:01:51.492" style="s2">It&#39;s a bar, Aunt Bee. Everybody&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.252" end="01:01:55.172" style="s2">welcome.</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.492" end="01:01:55.172" style="s2">Nobody&#39;s in charge of anybody.</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.202" end="01:01:57.222" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.292" end="01:02:01.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Except me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.132" end="01:02:03.117" style="s2">Window stool.</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.097" end="01:02:03.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.682" end="01:02:07.703" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.532" end="01:02:18.783" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before the band starts, Miss Meg wants</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.012" end="01:02:20.412" style="s2">to make a toast.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.783" end="01:02:22.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.412" end="01:02:24.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg steps up onto a small step stool by</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.932" end="01:02:26.698" style="s2">the bar with her glass raised.</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.678" end="01:02:26.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.132" end="01:02:34.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years ago, I married the wrong man.</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.052" end="01:02:37.778" style="s2">I&#39;ll be [music] honest.</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.932" end="01:02:39.452" style="s2">Marrying him was my worst mistake.</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.778" end="01:02:41.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.452" end="01:02:43.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard lowers his eyes at the end of</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.332" end="01:02:43.812" style="s2">the bar.</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.638" end="01:02:47.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.132" end="01:02:52.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But it taught me the best thing my</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.732" end="01:02:54.492" style="s2">father ever said.</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.852" end="01:02:56.852" style="s2">Read everything before you [music] sign</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.492" end="01:02:56.852" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.452" end="01:03:03.292" style="s2">To Arnie Lindquist.</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.332" end="01:03:05.372" style="s2">To the drivers. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.292" end="01:03:07.253" style="s2">And to Henry, who poured and paid</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.372" end="01:03:08.212" style="s2">attention.</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.253" end="01:03:12.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.212" end="01:03:12.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry puts his hand on his heart.</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.113" end="01:03:17.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.372" end="01:03:21.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The whole bar raises glasses cheers</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.613" end="01:03:24.938" style="s2">under [music] the photo of the old truck</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.213" end="01:03:26.958" style="s2">as Meg stands on the step stool.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.938" end="01:03:26.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.733" end="01:03:32.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And to me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.653" end="01:03:34.818" style="s2">I TYPED EVERYTHING.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.798" end="01:03:34.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.418" end="01:03:39.349" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.773" end="01:03:41.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; AUNT B, GET DOWN.</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.349" end="01:03:41.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.453" end="01:03:51.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NOT UNTIL [music] SOMEBODY DANCES WITH</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.333" end="01:03:51.773" style="s2">ME.</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.213" end="01:03:57.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss B,</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.453" end="01:03:59.213" style="s2">may I?</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.373" end="01:04:00.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, I thought you&#39;d never [music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.213" end="01:04:03.133" style="s2">ask.</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.773" end="01:04:05.333" style="s2">32 years.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.133" end="01:04:06.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry dances slowly with B in the middle</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.333" end="01:04:09.333" style="s2">of the sunny [music] bar as drivers</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.813" end="01:04:09.333" style="s2">clap.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.789" end="01:04:12.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause and music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.093" end="01:04:20.893" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, are you okay? Really?</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.213" end="01:04:20.893" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, I&#39;ve never been better.</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.493" end="01:04:26.893" style="s2">30 years married.</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.573" end="01:04:29.784" style="s2">One morning</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.893" end="01:04:31.804" style="s2">to read it all.</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.784" end="01:04:31.804" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.853" end="01:04:36.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa&#39;s thing.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.989" end="01:04:39.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.453" end="01:04:44.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa&#39;s thing.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.133" end="01:04:44.133" style="s2">Now it&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.814" end="01:04:50.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.213" end="01:04:52.764" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam CEO.</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.744" end="01:04:52.764" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.853" end="01:04:58.493" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interim.</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.573" end="01:05:06.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody&#39;s interim forever, Meg.</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.413" end="01:05:08.484" style="s2">I&#39;ve read the bylaws.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.464" end="01:05:08.484" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.413" end="01:05:14.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So have I.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.359" end="01:05:14.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.980" end="01:05:18.213" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.093" end="01:05:21.530" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meg walks to the window and looks out at</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.213" end="01:05:23.550" style="s2">the trucks rolling along the sunny dock.</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.530" end="01:05:23.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
